{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/461298-are-there-no-consequences-to-wearing-exploited-gadgets","id":461298,"title":"Are there no consequences to wearing exploited gadgets?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-29T12:02:32-07:00","id":461298,"title":"Are there no consequences to wearing exploited gadgets?","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Demon the Descent p187<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Whatever the change, an Exploited gadget is never mistaken for mundane. At best a Demon might be able to pass one off as a prop or toy, but that is unlikely to fool a savvy agent.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">p188<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Despite the risks, these gadgets do carry some advantages over raw Exploits. They do not evoke a compromise when activated</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">So they don't look normal, for example I'm thinking of having a character with a jacket that is Tron-esque and has <i>Deep Pockets</i>. Her general explanation might be that it's a cool looking running jacket, that the lights are just to make sure she stays safe in the dark.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">But wearing this thing in public causes no risk of compromise? Hunter angels can't tell? stigmatics? I feel like I'm missing something, and that there is a risk to wearing them.</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":4046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","user":"xenoterracide","date":". 03-29-2015, 03:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T12:23:41-07:00","id":461327,"title":"","content":"*cough*<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>p111</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Stockpiles exhibit two distinctive properties: as reservoirs of Aether, they register to demons\u2019 aetheric resonance (see p.184).</div> </div> </div> </div>*coughcough*<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>p187</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exploited gadgets do not require Aether to function, but they can be detected with aetheric resonance and may act as stockpiles (p. 111) for excess energy.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T12:59:10-07:00","id":461360,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/461298-are-there-no-consequences-to-wearing-exploited-gadgets#post461298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Demon the Descent p187<br /> <br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">p188<br /> <br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">So they don't look normal, for example I'm thinking of having a character with a jacket that is Tron-esque and has <i>Deep Pockets</i>. Her general explanation might be that it's a cool looking running jacket, that the lights are just to make sure she stays safe in the dark.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">But wearing this thing in public causes no risk of compromise? Hunter angels can't tell? stigmatics? I feel like I'm missing something, and that there is a risk to wearing them.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>They don't look normal <i>at all</i>. Waering this thing in public would certainly risk compromise. A better bet is to get, say, a Rubik's Cube with deep pockets and keep that -in- the jacket, out of sight. Rather than wearing a jacket made out of floating lights that constantly buzzes with code and sheds motes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">an Exploited gadget is <b>never mistaken for mundane</b></span></span></span></span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T14:58:37-07:00","id":461518,"title":"","content":"You stand out. That's a huge issue. Being able to spoof is a huge advantage to a demon, as is blending in. Walking around with something that's obviously not mundane may lead to Compromise checks, yes. But the mere fact that people will be watching you because you stand out is generally bad.<br /> <br /> And that's before we get fellow demons honing in on you without a chance to spoof, as well as the angel's pet stigmatics that can detect aether.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}